<!-- Order Up's sprite sheet: every drawing in the game, once, as an SVG
     <symbol> on a 64 x 64 box. Used by <use href="#s-name">. Shared with
     game/style-sheet.html (game/make-style-sheet.js puts this file into it),
     so the sheet and the game can't drift.

     The rules (game/README.md, "Art direction"): flat shapes, the house
     outline (#1F4552, 2.5 on this box, never black), rounded joins. The house
     shadow is CSS on the element that holds the sprite, not drawn here.

     Food that cooks takes its colours from CSS custom properties, so one
     drawing serves raw, done and burnt: --food (the main colour), --food2
     (a second colour where there is one) and --marks (0 or 1, the grill
     marks). play.css sets them per state; the defaults here are "done".
     Plain SVG only: no Nunjucks tags, so the style sheet can read it too. -->
